1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 11=

10
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:02,870
It's late and the night air is cold.

11
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,600
Be careful not to catch a chill.

12
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:15,060
Eunuch Li.

13
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:16,500
Your Majesty.

14
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:17,700
I am tired.

15
00:01:18,170 --> 00:01:19,320
Escort the Noble Consort
back to her palace.

16
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:21,900
Your Highness.

17
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:24,270
Please don't make things
difficult for me.

18
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:26,110
Your Highness.

19
00:01:27,180 --> 00:01:27,860
This way, please.

20
00:01:30,830 --> 00:01:31,750
Please.

21
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:40,620
Consort Liang.

22
00:01:41,150 --> 00:01:42,430
The prince is gravely ill.

23
00:01:43,350 --> 00:01:45,220
Why haven't you summoned
an imperial physician?

24
00:01:48,180 --> 00:01:49,940
I went down on my knees
throughout the palace,

25
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,710
begging the Empress to show mercy

26
00:01:53,390 --> 00:01:54,980
and save my son.

27
00:01:58,390 --> 00:02:00,260
But she stopped me at every turn.

28
00:02:00,710 --> 00:02:02,590
In this palace,

29
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:04,950
who would dare come to his aid?

30
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:06,900
Fate can be cruel.

31
00:02:07,510 --> 00:02:09,030
How cruel fate can be.

32
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:10,950
His Majesty has passed away.

33
00:02:12,110 --> 00:02:13,670
She has no son of her own,

34
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:16,830
so now she has set her sights on mine.

35
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:19,980
She wants to adopt him

36
00:02:21,180 --> 00:02:23,670
and have him inherit
the throne as Crown Prince,

37
00:02:24,470 --> 00:02:26,540
so she can control him as her puppet.

38
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:33,110
She has planned it all out well.

39
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:35,390
What can we do now?

40
00:02:49,110 --> 00:02:52,140
The Empress has never
seen my son's true face.

41
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:55,110
I have a plan

42
00:02:56,620 --> 00:02:58,620
that will allow you to fulfill your duty

43
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:04,310
and give her exactly what she wants.

44
00:03:06,070 --> 00:03:07,540
Please tell me, Consort Liang.

45
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,950
My daughter, Ruyi,

46
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:15,980
is one year older than my son.

47
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:19,630
She can disguise herself as a boy

48
00:03:20,390 --> 00:03:21,540
and take my son's place

49
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:24,230
as Emperor.

50
00:03:24,790 --> 00:03:25,830
Mother.

51
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:33,070
Hao!

52
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:34,630
Hao!

53
00:03:52,020 --> 00:03:53,020
Eunuch Li.

54
00:03:56,540 --> 00:04:00,260
You have no choice now.

55
00:04:10,540 --> 00:04:11,260
Ruyi.

56
00:04:13,540 --> 00:04:14,950
From this moment on,

57
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:17,700
forget that you are a girl.

58
00:04:18,830 --> 00:04:20,350
Forget your name.

59
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:24,140
You are Yuwen Minghao.

60
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:26,790
You are a boy.

61
00:04:28,070 --> 00:04:31,300
You must take your younger brother's
place and secure the throne.

62
00:04:32,140 --> 00:04:33,540
Do you understand?

63
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:37,460
Do you understand?

64
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:41,100
(How foolish of me
to think my sincerity)

65
00:05:41,100 --> 00:05:43,100
(could ever warm a heart so cold.)

66
00:05:44,550 --> 00:05:45,510
(Aren't you also)

67
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:47,310
(a prisoner bound
by the imperial robes?)

68
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:50,190
(The one I should truly resent)

69
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:52,510
(is my so-called brother,)

70
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:55,900
(who cast me into this palace
that consumes all within it)

71
00:05:56,510 --> 00:05:58,020
(and had the audacity to call it)

72
00:05:58,430 --> 00:05:59,870
(the highest honor.)

73
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:04,340
(But the greatest fool was still me.)

74
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:06,630
(I knew it was all a game,)

75
00:06:07,190 --> 00:06:10,630
(yet foolishly believed
I could still win something from it.)

76
00:06:20,070 --> 00:06:21,780
Do you remember

77
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:23,780
how you used to

78
00:06:24,660 --> 00:06:26,750
push me on this swing?

79
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:36,950
I remember.

80
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:39,190
You always said

81
00:06:40,070 --> 00:06:41,830
you wanted to swing
all the way up to the heavens

82
00:06:41,870 --> 00:06:43,550
and see what lay beyond the clouds.

83
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:45,780
When was it

84
00:06:47,430 --> 00:06:49,430
that you stopped pushing this swing

85
00:06:51,750 --> 00:06:53,020
and instead began pushing me

86
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:57,070
step by step into
an abyss with no end in sight?

87
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:03,340
The Grand Secretariat
has been busy lately.

88
00:07:04,190 --> 00:07:05,830
I haven't given you enough attention,

89
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:07,750
but you have always been on my mind.

90
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,610
You and His Majesty
are deeply devoted to each other.

91
00:07:10,990 --> 00:07:12,660
A mother gains standing through her son.

92
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:14,260
Before you entered the palace,

93
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:15,990
I reminded you of that time and again.

94
00:07:17,140 --> 00:07:18,550
Have you forgotten

95
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,170
after only three years in the palace?

96
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:22,020
How could I forget?

97
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:25,220
But His Majesty is burdened
with affairs of state

98
00:07:26,020 --> 00:07:28,020
and often works late
into the night in the Imperial Study.

99
00:07:29,020 --> 00:07:30,510
There are simply

100
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,610
few opportunities for us to be together.

101
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:58,140
Greetings, Your Majesty.

102
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:03,290
You've come at just the right time.

103
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:05,950
There is something troubling me.

104
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:11,550
Cui Rongyin has discovered
that I am a woman.

105
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:16,830
Twenty years ago,

106
00:08:17,830 --> 00:08:19,430
the road leading out of the cold palace

107
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:21,580
was the longest and loneliest road

108
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:24,700
Your Majesty ever walked.

109
00:08:26,700 --> 00:08:27,430
Now,

110
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:30,660
Cui Rongyin has discovered
Your Majesty's true identity as a woman.

111
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:32,460
This matter

112
00:08:34,550 --> 00:08:35,950
must be handled by you.

113
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:39,430
Your Majesty means

114
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:41,780
for me to use
the golden needle technique

115
00:08:42,220 --> 00:08:43,430
to kill without leaving a trace?

116
00:08:45,870 --> 00:08:46,950
You are not an executioner.

117
00:08:48,450 --> 00:08:49,650
That is not what His Majesty intends.

118
00:08:50,310 --> 00:08:52,430
His Majesty only wants you to develop

119
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,870
a medicine that can erase memories,

120
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:56,750
so Cui Rongyin will forget that night

121
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:58,950
and forget
His Majesty's secret entirely.

122
00:09:00,020 --> 00:09:01,460
A medicine that erases memories...

123
00:09:03,070 --> 00:09:04,310
But I believe

124
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:06,140
that with your ingenuity,

125
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:09,140
you can surely find a better solution

126
00:09:09,430 --> 00:09:11,260
to put His Majesty's mind at ease.

127
00:09:19,310 --> 00:09:19,950
Rongyin.

128
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:22,220
These ingredients

129
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:24,460
were all your favorites in the past.

130
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,660
I even added

131
00:09:26,660 --> 00:09:28,460
a little lard
to the broth for extra flavor.

132
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:29,580
Go on, try some.

133
00:09:32,190 --> 00:09:33,460
How thoughtful of you.

134
00:09:35,310 --> 00:09:36,830
You are my only sister.

135
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:37,910
Of course I would be.

136
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:45,700
Rongyin.

137
00:09:47,310 --> 00:09:49,980
Do you still remember
Father's dying words?

138
00:09:51,980 --> 00:09:53,460
Only by rising to the top

139
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:55,950
can you keep others
from controlling your fate.

140
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:58,220
I remember.

141
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:01,620
That Gu Hanyi

142
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:04,830
knows secrets
she should never have learned.

143
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:06,100
She must disappear.

144
00:10:10,620 --> 00:10:12,550
Gu Hanyi is a highly skilled physician.

145
00:10:13,070 --> 00:10:14,670
She even cured my headaches.

146
00:10:15,150 --> 00:10:18,190
Can't you bring her over to our side?

147
00:10:19,500 --> 00:10:21,910
Treating the sick and saving lives
is simply a physician's duty.

148
00:10:22,090 --> 00:10:23,130
There is no need
to feel indebted to her.

149
00:10:24,430 --> 00:10:26,340
She has already chosen her side.

150
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:28,380
We must not underestimate her.

151
00:10:31,310 --> 00:10:33,830
Compared with the honor
and future of the entire Cui family,

152
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:36,500
a mere female medical attendant
is insignificant.

153
00:10:39,310 --> 00:10:41,270
The higher I rise,

154
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:43,460
the more secure

155
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:45,220
your position in the palace will be.

156
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:49,270
Even if you never bear a child,

157
00:10:50,070 --> 00:10:53,270
I can ensure that you never
lose His Majesty's favor.

158
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:54,430
Come.

159
00:11:00,430 --> 00:11:01,500
We siblings

160
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:04,790
will share both glory and disgrace.

161
00:11:14,310 --> 00:11:19,670
(Gu Hanyi, let's see
who can save you this time.)

162
00:11:29,100 --> 00:11:29,500
Come.

163
00:11:54,460 --> 00:11:57,320
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

164
00:11:58,080 --> 00:12:01,020
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

165
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:04,500
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

166
00:12:05,350 --> 00:12:08,340
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

167
00:12:09,190 --> 00:12:12,510
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

168
00:12:12,850 --> 00:12:16,140
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

169
00:12:16,490 --> 00:12:22,970
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

170
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:30,850
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

171
00:12:33,350 --> 00:12:41,200
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

172
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:43,310
♪I stand here today♪

173
00:12:43,450 --> 00:12:47,960
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

174
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:55,450
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

175
00:12:56,090 --> 00:12:57,380
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

176
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:59,780
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

177
00:13:00,220 --> 00:13:07,070
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
